{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1000_p", "source_sha256": "986c3a9cf4fd8ecd7006aa619a17cf2ba008ccbcf4cdc6c92b83c71ecd00c9fb", "ja": "（やよいに、CMのオファーが来た！\nこの時間なら、やよいはまだ劇場にいるな……）", "zh": "（弥生接到了广告的邀约！\n这个时间的话，弥生应该还在剧场……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "955ee73c0a8555c891e1ecd5d6cfabbba54dfeff5329373d197e011f89565fee", "ja": "でもホント、すごいよね。土曜お昼の情報番組に、\nそれもレギュラー出演だなんて……。", "zh": "不过，真的很厉害呢。竟然要在周六中午的资讯节目里，而且还是固定出演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "5e4426e9b927982778f088940a1407fb61102880086f374d26da8f52114a12c1", "ja": "視聴率だって、かなり多いだろうし……。\nこれを足がかりに、一気にブレイクも夢じゃないわね！", "zh": "收视率应该也相当高吧……。\n以此为跳板，一举走红也不是梦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "dc57f0c74c6608d44a076dd1c1d1854f70f648faf421dd1187e40ba5cbf06f5d", "ja": "ブレイク……。でも、私がやってるのって、\n節約レシピとかポイントでお得にする方法とかですよ？", "zh": "走红……可是，我做的不都是节约食谱，还有利用积分省钱的方法吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "b1082021eb88a157fab2777d1b7dc489368b5fb754cfeba212e318341feb175d", "ja": "親しみやすくていいじゃない。何より、\n一般層への知名度が上がるって、すごいことなのよ。", "zh": "这样亲切接地气不是挺好的嘛。最重要的是，\n在大众中提高知名度，这可是了不起的事哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "76ca202856fe1b967fe6eb317a91ba0057ad9eb70c632f689f676df64ea38d1a", "ja": "そっかぁ……。\nたくさんお仕事できるのはうれしいから、いいかも！", "zh": "这样啊……  \n能接到很多工作的话，我会很开心，所以也不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1006_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6d29a06d955b82d60cc2307024d40c50de98e7444244e3c63a7b6510537f2c3e", "ja": "やよい、ビッグニュースが……！\nおっ、雪歩、律子もいたのか。お疲れさま！", "zh": "弥生，有个大新闻……！\n哦，雪步和律子也在啊。辛苦啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "aba9097c6945bedec810b4a45c6d3e2a5eab8727c88a757934062a3c7300b238", "ja": "ビッグニュース？", "zh": "大新闻？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "026be3c9f5f69630e3760b84d57980f1b2cd1a2e8f3dbcf44dc24e0ba38c8725", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\n慌てて、どうかしたんですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n这么慌慌张张的，是出什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1010_p", "source_sha256": "59ee7a2e25cc26f9b7cfe8096045f8d9cedbb9e3dc450e5d77c526f1433e2c01", "ja": "ああ。実はやよいに、情報番組のスポンサーでもある\n大手食品メーカーから、CMのオファーが来たんだ！", "zh": "啊。其实，大型食品厂商给弥生发来了广告邀约，这家厂商还是那档资讯节目的赞助商！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1011_p", "source_sha256": "93291759281b201f527718c6c90c19f58ceb39604f36bec5d81974b07f3ce70a", "ja": "なんでも、新しく出す調味料シリーズだとか。\n時間もお得に節約しちゃいましょう、がコピーらしい。", "zh": "听说是他们要推出的新调味料系列。\n广告词好像是“轻松节省时间吧”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "0bc85a997817fd1ef89517064c7de1b050e8e5523ee77c438e354dc277eaac2f", "ja": "CM……。ええっ！　わ、私にですか！？", "zh": "广告……。诶诶！找、找我拍吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f3c5deaa5221575a735705dbe40034f11945516537a5734903eaa2cd1fba958d", "ja": "ああ。すごい事だぞ！", "zh": "啊。这可是不得了的大事啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "3c1807e38c6a51700c6bb044531b78b9778902e2e816a38f5351417bcb30ac37", "ja": "やったじゃない、やよい！\nこれはもう知名度爆上がり、間違いなしね！", "zh": "太棒了，弥生！这下知名度肯定会暴涨，绝对没错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9369da38729f80694acc91ccfe7fc54ce36d70b2b972778e2b5bba4a96a520e1", "ja": "CMかぁ、すごいな……！\nおめでとう、やよいちゃん！", "zh": "广告啊，好厉害呀……！\n恭喜你，弥生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1016_005yay", "source_sha256": "8ed80b418d664c7631ef24ac9a7466b2c26f13731cbdd4d7ee72af1d33cfab1c", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\nけど、私でいいのかなぁ……？", "zh": "谢谢！\n不过，真的由我来可以吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1017_p", "source_sha256": "c108d84b11c971c39fe6b2e343c8f91fb06432e57c3f495c262ea9733849878d", "ja": "もちろん。情報番組での、やよいの仕事が\n認められたんだ。誇っていいと思うぞ。", "zh": "当然了。你在资讯节目里的工作表现\n得到了认可。我觉得你完全可以引以为豪哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1018_p", "source_sha256": "bc7f4ece926cee6354ebfd563402efa4231bcfec81c1b1c5a976b3817654d992", "ja": "メーカーさんから、調味料のサンプルももらったんだ。\n試しに、料理を作ってみてほしいとの事だ。", "zh": "厂家还送来了调味料样品。希望你能试着用它们做做菜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1019_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5bc50e0aaea9ffbc60b0c49debcc8b613aa546c36538427cb9f6bd998e6889e0", "ja": "わぁ、色んな種類があるね。\nハンバーグに、こっちは豚の生姜焼き……。", "zh": "哇，种类好多啊。\n汉堡肉，这边是生姜烧猪肉……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "dec4dfad81a767f01c2b6d3822a6f52788e57d1dc623fb6bd3960efa03ce51d2", "ja": "なるほど、メインのおかずを時短で作れる\n合わせ調味料なのね……なかなか便利そうだわ。", "zh": "原来如此，是能快速做好主菜的复合调味料啊……看起来还真挺方便的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1021_p", "source_sha256": "194f3dd1c01c8550389434dedcd962b649a9eac0631427ae650837953372ac1f", "ja": "料理を作って、気に入ったらでいい。\nやよいの意見も、色々聞かせてほしいそうだ。", "zh": "只要做好了菜，要是喜欢的话就行。\n他们说也想多听听弥生的意见呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1022_005yay", "source_sha256": "35305350eaa13fb40f7706ca7e2ace6c541b4116e289d3b1998342334a0d0874", "ja": "{$P$}……わかりました！\n私、さっそく家で作ってみますね！", "zh": "{$P$}……我明白了！\n我这就回家试着做做看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1023_null", "source_sha256": "8664ddbf41c8511c18c71ead4ae9125d0f262b7ef2a072e62bb8343bae5e462e", "ja": "帰宅後……", "zh": "回家后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1024_005yay", "source_sha256": "f735b47498a413f04cb136403a889f22fc8460e96641f61fdaccc9094db33c50", "ja": "ふんふんふーん。……えへへっ♪", "zh": "哼哼哼——……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1025_kasumi2", "source_sha256": "4ba23c9eebb0c1a0c69afd6ccc7fe25d4d9d640a441a68660cc5f859619aada7", "ja": "お姉ちゃん、今日はなんだか楽しそう。\n何かいいことあったの？", "zh": "姐姐今天看起来好像特别开心。\n是遇到什么好事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1026_005yay", "source_sha256": "7d04fe91f3bc062faf8b14ca69bb2b3dddacdd5e3084cb5092e716e3f3e1fb65", "ja": "うん！　あっ、でも……。", "zh": "嗯！啊，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1027_p", "source_sha256": "8de5c70a539ad6e9f5351eb6e6a0ae0593d8530115158a9e94d919543fca6c1e", "ja": "「CMの事は、クライアントがいる事だから。\n正式発表があるまで、絶対人に言っちゃダメだぞ」", "zh": "「广告的事牵涉到客户。\n在正式公布之前，绝对不能跟别人说哦」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1028_p", "source_sha256": "d354b59f069005cf5fc63a2ba8c1b8bee24c7a1cd6ec430a5a600ebd40a5032b", "ja": "「契約金の事とかもあるし……。\nご家族には、ひとまず事務所から連絡するからな」", "zh": "「还有报酬之类的事情要谈……\n你家里那边，事务所会先去联系的」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1029_005yay", "source_sha256": "7aad003d7a781dd8a965fbc35913d1567cc847d976f7b3d9a933cde54886c279", "ja": "えっと、まだナイショだって、\n{$P$}に言われてるんだ。", "zh": "那个，还不能说，{$P$}让我先保密。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1030_005yay", "source_sha256": "ce7ec18e22574618aa5996feaf5abfb89bf00d9d544878a9be68c80f5783f82f", "ja": "話してよくなったら、みんなに言うからね！", "zh": "等可以说了，我就告诉大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1031_kasumi2", "source_sha256": "c4252f50a5f30504f11f3a2c54b20b80555afe506456b94022360c5699d38679", "ja": "うん、わかった！\n……あれ？　浩太郎、立ち止まってどうしたの？", "zh": "嗯，我知道了！\n……咦？浩太郎，你怎么停下来了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1032_koutaro", "source_sha256": "40935a2ea4a37e5b2db7cdb5a8825309cf62ce5841ebac4b0747b514540c03ec", "ja": "やよい姉ちゃん。\nぼく、お肉が食べたい！", "zh": "弥生姐姐。\n我想吃肉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1033_kouji", "source_sha256": "206d53cee7bee97523ee99c220a745cc715f7fd939bb7499be9e931e46c7b501", "ja": "あっ、こうたろう兄ちゃんずるい！\nお姉ちゃん、ぼくも！", "zh": "啊，幸太郎哥哥太狡猾了！\n姐姐，我也要！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1034_chousuke", "source_sha256": "76bcfaaa627d7831812d3f937b36dc2610eefb379c94d919c7a879405c5fb1d0", "ja": "こら、こうたろう。コウジも、\nやよいお姉ちゃんにワガママ言っちゃダメだろ。", "zh": "喂，Kotaro。Koji也是，不可以对弥生姐姐任性哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1035_koutaro", "source_sha256": "c3c17267353e48d7e3925013f4f6bb0737a1788ae984eccb10e7c73489b081af", "ja": "ちょうすけ兄ちゃんだって食べたいくせにー。", "zh": "长助哥哥明明也想吃嘛——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1036_kouji", "source_sha256": "b919531d10e894934a0c68701b37d067d133e75044c3b7466d701eddc00e0f46", "ja": "くせにー。", "zh": "明明……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1037_chousuke", "source_sha256": "2d2093e3a10496a1130ab4011ac85c95eae0720791b15e8ed933344d0c8991d7", "ja": "う……。", "zh": "呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1038_005yay", "source_sha256": "4f059dc89eafd4d38c5e0aacb7d368b5f9999feafbddb535d30d5257946d6f4c", "ja": "うん……そうだよね。\nみんな、育ちざかりだもんね。", "zh": "嗯……也是呢。\n毕竟大家都在长身体嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1039_005yay", "source_sha256": "ee004b42e52a6cfde5676064e15057225aa73fb1cf36a5d36b15e938d968dca9", "ja": "それに、今日はお給料日だし。\nちょっぴり、フンパツしちゃおうかな。えへへっ！", "zh": "而且今天还是发工资的日子。\n要不要稍微奢侈一下呢？嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1040_kasumi2", "source_sha256": "9a1131b4df8c814316bac3f338bda009d21d7d888731e0b48936c10bc8f7cf52", "ja": "お姉ちゃん……いいの？", "zh": "姐姐……真的可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_118_1041_005yay", "source_sha256": "5271dbdb239da5671f46ab0ebb47be4051e793fd8a627010cc95d555ef139453", "ja": "うん！　あ、でもステーキとかは無理だからね。\nハンバーグか、豚コマで生姜焼きにしようかなって。", "zh": "嗯！啊，不过牛排之类的可不行哦。\n我在想要不要做汉堡肉，或者用猪肉片做姜汁烧肉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
